# This site has no build step and does not read a .env file.
# Blog posts are edited in Pages CMS (https://app.pagescms.org) and saved as
# Markdown files in content/posts. The public repository settings live in
# js/config.js: GITHUB_OWNER, GITHUB_REPO, and GITHUB_BRANCH.
# Do not put an API token in js/ or in any HTML file.
